<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 125 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 125 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nikko.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA AG</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0195  PAY DATE  S-03.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.832    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT GILT DUE 1999  NOTES	THERE IS A STATUTORY GUARANTEE BY VIENNA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
